    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MRS. KINGSLEY: Tasha. How many times I’m gonna have to tell you to clean the dishes before I come home?\nNATASHA: You haven’t even closed the door yet and you’re already yelling--\nMRS. KINGSLEY: It’s not enough to pick up dirty plates at work? I come home to pick up dirty plates too?!\nNATASHA: Mom, please. I’ll do it now.",
      "NATASHA: I’ll be back later.\nMRS. KINGSLEY: You have a lot to finish here. I still see open boxes in your room.\nNATASHA: Mom, I really gotta go.",
      "NATASHA: I heard what you told mom after the play--\nMRS. KINGSLEY: Baby. There’s no point in rehashing all this now.",
      "BEV: I’m booking my flight now! Christmas in Jamaica is a thing, right?\nNATASHA: Yes, I believe so. I’m so sorry, Bev. It all happened so fast.\nNATASHA: I have to go. I’ll call you soon as I land. Love you."
    ]
